# Dependencies. This project has zero runtime/build dependencies by design
# (see README "Architecture") — node_modules only ever appears when a
# development tool (e.g. Playwright, for a one-off manual browser QA pass)
# is installed temporarily with `npm install --no-save` and is expected to
# be removed again afterward. Never commit it.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*

# Secrets / environment files. None are used by this app (it is 100%
# client-side with no API keys or server config), but this is a hard
# default so one can never be committed by accident.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Claude Code: settings.json (shared, committed) configures the project for
# everyone; settings.local.json is a per-developer override and must never
# be shared or committed.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS-generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Logs and ad-hoc local scratch files
*.log
*.tmp
